uality religion faith is i\'m a big believer in christ consciousness and jesus i can i can connect to that energy and still connect to other energies i don\'t believe i have to be ring fenced into seeing that a certain way so you know that\'s what i was just saying to my friend i said yeah there are those who do that and they point the finger back at where they were and try and destroy it and there are those who go oh i\'ve grown into this and that\'s okay if that\'s how they\'re now experiencing their faith but i think the reason faith is becoming more important for people is in times of turmoil and trouble\n[speaker_1] people start to go within to look for something that can support them especially when things outside seem less stable or less predictable or less holding of you than ever before\n[speaker_2] yeah that uncertainty and that less holding is can totally fill that in the air it\'s but what i\'m hearing and sorry not but and what i\'m hearing is this there\'s a dismantling almost for a remantling\n[speaker_2] to happen at this time one of the things that stayed with me somewhere along in your energy updates is you said you\'d rather be stuck in a lift with someone kind and openhearted than someone spiritually learned who isn\'t kind and openhearted\n[speaker_1] yes\n[speaker_2] there\'s something about that that really stayed with me because it makes me wonder sometimes there\'s so many things about that but one of them that\'s you know a predisposition as well because i i\'ve met some people that have just arrived on the planet kind you know they never studied any of the work that you studied they\'ve never studied they\'ve never listened to one of your updates they\'ve never listened to my podcast they\'re just kind souls you know i\'ve got family members like this\n[speaker_2] yeah i mean what what is that do you think some of those people just they get it from another life or they just come in a little bit more whole but then there\'s also this whole 