(43, 10, 'TRANSCRIPTION', 'completed', 1, 4, 'pyai', 'job_uCkWlVATklluUAlk3h3LYgpN', '5:10:TRANSCRIPTION', '{\"text\": \"[speaker_1] one of the most challenging things about this time is we\'re in a very prophesied time of unrest uncertainty\\n[speaker_1] geopolitical events that are destabilizing\\n[speaker_1] climate events that are destabilizing and impactful\\n[speaker_1] the rise of darker energies that might want to whether they want it to look like a war or whether they want it to look like people being more divided amongst themselves i think that is the shadow side of what we\'re in as a world and i think for those of us who remember say the nineties or the eighties or the you know even the early or you know the two oh oh ohs i think it\'s quite\\n[speaker_1] impactful to walk through that as an energy field and i think about the people i meet who in their seventies and eighties who are walking through it and i\'m like wow you have seen some change because the climate is so different and there is this i think very intense energy in the world i felt it when i was touring and i was going to all these different cities you know i would just walk and pay attention and see how people were looking feeling being and of course cities are always a a skewed example because if you go to smaller towns or local more community based places you can feel softer energy but cities are a good example of of seeing how are people doing with all of this and for me there is the the overarching thing i could feel was how exhausting these times are for everyone\\n[speaker_1] very tiring times to go through it doesn\'t mean that\'s all it is and it doesn\'t mean you can\'t be having the best time of your life right now in some areas of your life there might be certain things in your life right now that are the most joyous the most impactful the most than than they\'ve ever been but just the temperature temperature of the world literally there is this kind of overwhelm and yet within it and this is the interesting part spiritual energy is ratcheting up in people\'s lives whether people are coming to it through visitations from angels or dead loved ones or who\'ve passed over\\n[speaker_1] more people are having more mystical experiences in the world with the land people reporting et experiences all of that is very strong right now and that\'s one of the things my guide\'s the z\'s had said they said you\'re gonna go through times on earth that will in a way dismantle your old world and in tandem with that you will see a massive rise in consciousness and at the time they said that maybe fifteen years ago i remember thinking oh i had an idea of what that would look like but what i\'m seeing is it\'s very varied and it\'s very personal recently i was talking to someone who was upset about\\n[speaker_1] someone that they knew in the spiritual field who was known who had now gone to jesus in christ consciousness and religion which we\'re seeing a lot and vice versa i\'ve also seen people walk away from religion during this time or you know shift into spirituality and the message my guides have always given me is it doesn\'t really matter how you are finding faith for yourself how your faith makes you behave toward others that\'s very interesting so you know i\'ve always said that i personally have never grown up in religion but i support any religion that helps people love each other more and become more of who they\'re here to be and live a more spirit filled life that\'s harmonic i don\'t support religion\'s disguise\\n[speaker_1] as war machines you know that a lot of religion will try and annihilate certain groups or certain people and and say it\'s in the name of god and it\'s like well who\'s god because there\'s a god on the other side of the world that the group you\'re trying to kill are are also believing in so i i think the reason i share that is just\\n[speaker_1] it\'s one of the themes i put in this month\'s energy update there is this weird almost breakdown around what spirituality religion faith is i\'m a big believer in christ consciousness and jesus i can i can connect to that energy and still connect to other energies i don\'t believe i have to be ring fenced into seeing that a certain way so you know that\'s what i was just saying to my friend i said yeah there are those who do that and they point the finger back at where they were and try and destroy it and there are those who go oh i\'ve grown into this and that\'s okay if that\'s how they\'re now experiencing their faith but i think the reason faith is becoming more important for people is in times of turmoil and trouble\\n[speaker_1] people start to go within to look for something that can support them especially when things outside seem less stable or less predictable or less holding of you than ever before\\n[speaker_2] yeah that uncertainty and that less holding is can totally fill that in the air it\'s but what i\'m hearing and sorry not but and what i\'m hearing is this there\'s a dismantling almost for a remantling\\n[speaker_2] to happen at this time one of the things that stayed with me somewhere along in your energy updates is you said you\'d rather be stuck in a lift with someone kind and openhearted than someone spiritually learned who isn\'t kind and openhearted\\n[speaker_1] yes\\n[speaker_2] there\'s something about that that really stayed with me because it makes me wonder sometimes there\'s so many things about that but one of them that\'s you know a predisposition as well because i i\'ve met some people that have just arrived on the planet kind you know they never studied any of the work that you studied they\'ve never studied they\'ve never listened to one of your updates they\'ve never listened to my podcast they\'re just kind souls you know i\'ve got family members like this\\n[speaker_2] yeah i mean what what is that do you think some of those people just they get it from another life or they just come in a little bit more whole but then there\'s also this whole theme you know it it\'s a big ode to integration as well in many ways as well i mean i just wanted to yeah you mentioned that so it just came up for me\\n[speaker_1] i love that you bring this up and my perspective on this is that we are a culture who has wrongly been taught to worship the construct rather than the effect the construct gives us\\n[speaker_1] so you can be a very kind atheist\\n[speaker_1] being an atheist doesn\'t make you less kind equally being spiritually learned doesn\'t make you more kind\\n[speaker_1] and i think in the same way that in in you know that you can see religious groups fight each other i\'ve seen it in the spiritual field as well you meet people who want to you know feel superior to someone who isn\'t intuitive or they think because they\'ve done thirty ayahuasca trips that they are now far more enlightened than their grandmother who they see as closed minded but actually their grandmother might be the one going around the town checking everyone\'s okay whereas they\'re like off on their own you know their own\\n[speaker_1] journey and there\'s nothing wrong with either journey the problem is when we start pointing the finger at other people\'s journey and so i think there can be as much judgment in the spiritual community as there is in any community because you know humans are in the spiritual community and i think for a long time certainly when i was coming up even i had this belief a bit in in my late teens and early twenties when i was first reading books and going i was taking myself off to self growth workshops and spiritual workshops i think i thought that spirituality was going to make everything better\\n[speaker_1] and that\'s why we were doing it it\'s like it\'s gonna make everything better and we\'re gonna be enlightened and there\'s gonna be no distress and actually that\'s not earth school there are certainly aspects of spirituality and connection to a faith that can that can root you and that can help you be a better person in the world and help you experience the world in a better way but we\'re here on an evolutionary path and i think too often the construct\\n[speaker_1] has been proclaimed as the thing so it\'s like catholicism is the way or\\n[speaker_1] angel cards are the way or you know whatever it is\\n[speaker_1] raw food juicing is the way and and the truth is perhaps the people who proclaim that for them maybe it was or they\'ve decided that they they\'re just limited in sight they\'re not seeing anyone else in the world because they\'re so obsessed with their own raw juice lifestyle and they think everyone else is wrong that they\'ve put two and two together and come up with five so it\'s i for me\\n[speaker_1] the reason i say that and i\'ve said that a few times from stages too is\\n[speaker_1] was very aware when i first started doing this work i went from being a student of self growth and spirituality to sometimes being a teacher in that arena in two oh oh four\\n[speaker_1] and i\'m still a student i always will be\\n[speaker_1] but what i noticed was this tendency to give our power away to teachers to teachings to\\n[speaker_1] books to philosophies and as i met more of the humans behind some of those things i was like oh we\'re all still human and equally if people project onto me oh it must be amazing you know you\'ve you\'ve got the the z\'s everything must just be perfect and i\'m like no no i\'m i\'m human and i\'m going through all my own evolution too yeah it\'s not the kind of life i had thirty years ago that\'s for sure because my vantage point my perspective is so different now but it doesn\'t mean those parts of me that were five years old and ten years old have been annihilated they\'re also growing through me and so i think that\'s where my statement came from because i\'d met such brilliant atheists that i would love to be around and equally i\'d met some spiritual people who were using their spirituality as superiority or as a mask and again it\'s okay they can they can do what they want they can be who they want we have to decide\\n[speaker_1] who we are how we want to interact and what\'s important to us that\'s and that goes back to the empath narcissist dynamic i think think when you come out of one of those relationships you\'re often in grief in horror in shock you can\'t quite believe that someone could have behaved that way and then you know once you get through the more victim aspects of the consciousness and i\'m not making light of that because some people go through horror with narcissists so i\'m not wanting to make light of being a victim to a narcissist in your life but you do have to get to a point where you you recognize ah where were my blind spots how did i walk into that how do i change myself so that i don\'t experience that again because that was the lesson i was being shown that was the learning from this i have to take a learning from this and use it to reclaim myself rather than live in the ashes of feeling annihilated by a relationship or an authority figure\\n[speaker_2] hey there inspired evolutionary if you absolutely love this well then here\'s a full conversation with this guest on the inspired evolution podcast check it out now\", \"words\": [{\"word\": \"one\", \"endMs\": 240, \"speaker\": \"speaker_1\", \"startMs\": 0}, {\"word\": \"of\", \"endMs\": 320, \"speaker\": \"speaker_1\", \"startMs\": 240}, {\"word\": \"the\", \"endMs\": 480, \"speaker\": \"speaker_1\", \"startMs\": 320}, {\"word\": \"most\", \"endMs\": 720, \"speaker\": \"speaker_1\", \"startMs\": 480}, {\"word\": \"challenging\", \"endMs\": 1680, \"speaker\": \"speaker_1\", \"startMs\": 720}, {\"word\": \"things\", \"endMs\": 1840, \"speaker\": \"speaker_1\", \"startMs\": 1680}, {\"word\": \"about\", \"endMs\": 2080, \"speaker\": \"speaker_1\", \"startMs\": 1840}, {\"word\": \"this\", \"endMs\": 2320, \"speaker\": \"speaker_1\", \"startMs\": 2080}, {\"word\": \